      "description": "Route over the time picker range narrowed by Zoom, coloured by GPS speed (mph), up to 5000 points spread over the selected span. No-fix (empty gps) and (0,0) rows are dropped. cand keeps the last fix through a GPS dropout, so a dropout shows as a stall at one spot. Position is the full-precision one (gps_precise) where the row has it, otherwise the float32 gps; sigma_m is its 1-sigma horizontal accuracy, src 1 = standard, 2 = RTK.",
