      "description": "Lateral vs longitudinal g from the chudpi IMU (dynamics.gps_imu) over the time picker range narrowed by Zoom, coloured by GPS speed (mph). Up to 5000 points: one raw sample per span / 5000 (at least 100 ms). The raw axes are rotated onto the car's with the mount fitted on 2026-10-10, valid since ~2026-06-07: if 'IMU mount check' is far from 1.00 g the board sat differently and this plot is wrong. Samples with any axis >= 50 m/s², NaN, empty or all-zero are dropped. Dashed ring = 1 g.",
